 578:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         @ref ADC_LL_EF_Configuration_ADC_Group_Regular
 579:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         (functions with prefix "INJ").
