5059:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Get ADC group regular sequence: channel on the selected
5060:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         scan sequence rank.
5061:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, ADC group regular sequencer is
5062:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         fully configurable: sequencer length and each rank
5063:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         affectation to a channel are configurable.
5064:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Refer to description of function @ref LL_ADC_REG_SetSequencerLength().
5065:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Depending on devices and packages, some channels may not be available.
5066:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Refer to device datasheet for channels availability.
5067:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Usage of the returned channel number:
5068:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - To reinject this channel into another function LL_ADC_xxx:
5069:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           the returned channel number is only partly formatted on definition
5070:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           of literals LL_ADC_CHANNEL_x. Therefore, it has to be compared
5071:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           with parts of literals LL_ADC_CHANNEL_x or using
5072:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           helper macro @ref __LL_ADC_CHANNEL_TO_DECIMAL_NB().
5073:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           Then the selected literal LL_ADC_CHANNEL_x can be used
5074:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           as parameter for another function.
5075:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - To get the channel number in decimal format:
5076:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           process the returned value with the helper macro
5077:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           @ref __LL_ADC_CHANNEL_TO_DECIMAL_NB().
