6214:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Set sampling time of the selected ADC channel
6215:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Unit: ADC clock cycles.
6216:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this device, sampling time is on channel scope: independently
6217:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         of channel mapped on ADC group regular or injected.
6218:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   In case of internal channel (VrefInt, TempSensor, ...) to be
6219:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         converted:
6220:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         sampling time constraints must be respected (sampling time can be
6221:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         adjusted in function of ADC clock frequency and sampling time
6222:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         setting).
6223:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Refer to device datasheet for timings values (parameters TS_vrefint,
6224:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         TS_temp, ...).
6225:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Conversion time is the addition of sampling time and processing time.
6226:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         On this STM32 series, ADC processing time is:
