6435:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
6436:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Set mode single-ended or differential input of the selected
6437:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC channel.
6438:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Channel ending is on channel scope: independently of channel mapped
6439:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         on ADC group regular or injected.
6440:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         In differential mode: Differential measurement is carried out
6441:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         between the selected channel 'i' (positive input) and
6442:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         channel 'i+1' (negative input). Only channel 'i' has to be
6443:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         configured, channel 'i+1' is configured automatically.
6444:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Refer to Reference Manual to ensure the selected channel is
6445:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         available in differential mode.
6446:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         For example, internal channels (VrefInt, TempSensor, ...) are
6447:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         not available in differential mode.
6448:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   When configuring a channel 'i' in differential mode,
6449:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         the channel 'i+1' is not usable separately.
6450:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On STM32G4, some channels are internally fixed to single-ended inputs
6451:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         configuration:
6452:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - ADC1: Channels 12, 15, 16, 17 and 18
6453:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - ADC2: Channels 15, 17 and 18
6454:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - ADC3: Channels 12, 16, 17 and 18            (1)
6455:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - ADC4: Channels 16, 17 and 18                (1)
6456:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - ADC5: Channels 2, 3, 4, 16, 17 and 18       (1)
6457:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         (1) ADC3/4/5 are not available on all devices, refer to device datasheet
6458:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             for more details.
6459:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   For ADC channels configured in differential mode, both inputs
6460:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         should be biased at (Vref+)/2 +/-200mV.
6461:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         (Vref+ is the analog voltage reference)
6462:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, setting of this feature is conditioned to
6463:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC state:
6464:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC must be ADC disabled.
6465:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   One or several values can be selected.
6466:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Example: (LL_ADC_CHANNEL_4 | LL_ADC_CHANNEL_12 | ...)
6467:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @rmtoll DIFSEL   DIFSEL         LL_ADC_SetChannelSingleDiff
6468:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  ADCx ADC instance
6469:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  Channel This parameter can be one of the following values:
