  72:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     (#) Enable the ADC interface
  73:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****         (++) As prerequisite, ADC clock must be configured at RCC top level.
  74:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  75:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****         (++) Two clock settings are mandatory:
  76:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****              (+++) ADC clock (core clock, also possibly conversion clock).
  77:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  78:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****              (+++) ADC clock (conversions clock).
  79:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                    Two possible clock sources: synchronous clock derived from AHB clock
  80:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                    or asynchronous clock derived from system clock or PLL (output divider P)
  81:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                    running up to 75MHz.
  82:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  83:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****              (+++) Example:
  84:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                    Into HAL_ADC_MspInit() (recommended code location) or with
  85:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                    other device clock parameters configuration:
  86:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                (+++) __HAL_RCC_ADC_CLK_ENABLE();                  (mandatory)
  87:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
