 266:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      all callbacks are set to the corresponding weak functions:
 267:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      examples @ref HAL_ADC_ConvCpltCallback(), @ref HAL_ADC_ErrorCallback().
 268:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      Exception done for MspInit and MspDeInit functions that are
 269:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      reset to the legacy weak functions in the @ref HAL_ADC_Init()/ @ref HAL_ADC_DeInit() only when
 270:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      these callbacks are null (not registered beforehand).
 271:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     [..]
 272:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 273:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      If MspInit or MspDeInit are not null, the @ref HAL_ADC_Init()/ @ref HAL_ADC_DeInit()
 274:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      keep and use the user MspInit/MspDeInit callbacks (registered beforehand) whatever the state.
 275:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      [..]
 276:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 277:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      Callbacks can be registered/unregistered in @ref HAL_ADC_STATE_READY state only.
 278:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      Exception done MspInit/MspDeInit functions that can be registered/unregistered
 279:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      in @ref HAL_ADC_STATE_READY or @ref HAL_ADC_STATE_RESET state,
