 283:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      Then, the user first registers the MspInit/MspDeInit user callbacks
 284:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      using @ref HAL_ADC_RegisterCallback() before calling @ref HAL_ADC_DeInit()
