6984:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
6985:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Set ADC analog watchdog threshold value of threshold
6986:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         high or low.
6987:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   If values of both thresholds high or low must be set,
6988:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         use function @ref LL_ADC_ConfigAnalogWDThresholds().
6989:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   In case of ADC resolution different of 12 bits,
6990:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         analog watchdog thresholds data require a specific shift.
6991:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Use helper macro @ref __LL_ADC_ANALOGWD_SET_THRESHOLD_RESOLUTION().
6992:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, there are 2 kinds of analog watchdog
6993:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         instance:
6994:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - AWD standard (instance AWD1):
6995:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - channels monitored: can monitor 1 channel or all channels.
6996:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - groups monitored: ADC groups regular and-or injected.
6997:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - resolution: resolution is not limited (corresponds to
6998:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             ADC resolution configured).
6999:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - AWD flexible (instances AWD2, AWD3):
7000:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - channels monitored: flexible on channels monitored, selection is
7001:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             channel wise, from from 1 to all channels.
7002:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             Specificity of this analog watchdog: Multiple channels can
7003:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             be selected. For example:
7004:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             (LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNEL4_REG_INJ | LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNEL5_REG_INJ | ...)
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccnoLzPE.s 			page 145


7005:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - groups monitored: not selection possible (monitoring on both
7006:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             groups regular and injected).
7007:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             Channels selected are monitored on groups regular and injected:
7008:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNELxx_REG_INJ (do not use parameters
7009:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNELxx_REG and LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNELxx_INJ)
7010:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - resolution: resolution is limited to 8 bits: if ADC resolution is
7011:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             12 bits the 4 LSB are ignored, if ADC resolution is 10 bits
7012:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             the 2 LSB are ignored.
7013:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   If ADC oversampling is enabled, ADC analog watchdog thresholds are
7014:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         impacted: the comparison of analog watchdog thresholds is done on
7015:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         oversampling final computation (after ratio and shift application):
7016:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC data register bitfield [15:4] (12 most significant bits).
7017:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Examples:
7018:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - Oversampling ratio and shift selected to have ADC conversion data
7019:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           on 12 bits (ratio 16 and shift 4, or ratio 32 and shift 5, ...):
7020:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           ADC analog watchdog thresholds must be divided by 16.
7021:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - Oversampling ratio and shift selected to have ADC conversion data
7022:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           on 14 bits (ratio 16 and shift 2, or ratio 32 and shift 3, ...):
7023:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           ADC analog watchdog thresholds must be divided by 4.
7024:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - Oversampling ratio and shift selected to have ADC conversion data
7025:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           on 16 bits (ratio 16 and shift none, or ratio 32 and shift 1, ...):
7026:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           ADC analog watchdog thresholds match directly to ADC data register.
7027:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, setting of this feature is not conditioned to
7028:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC state:
7029:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC can be disabled, enabled with or without conversion on going
7030:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         on either ADC groups regular or injected.
7031:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @rmtoll TR1      HT1            LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDThresholds\n
7032:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         TR2      HT2            LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDThresholds\n
7033:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         TR3      HT3            LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDThresholds\n
7034:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         TR1      LT1            LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDThresholds\n
7035:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         TR2      LT2            LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDThresholds\n
